618570","kind":"update","title":"Next Fest Demo Update","summary":"Hi everyone,To celebrate the just-started Steam Next Fest, we've updated the demo build with some extra goodies for you. The most notable of these are the new Interlopers. You have a super-rare chance to drop an interloper when you open any pack: a random hero from one of the packs that are included in the FULL game (Releasing November 10).Here's what's new in the demo update:Interlopers may drop from packsIllusionist's upgrades reworkedBalance adjustments to all enemiesFairer shop rollsSkill tr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:28:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691793","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4618570-1844751498225656","game_id":"steam-4618570","kind":"announcement","title":"New Languages Have Arrived!","summary":"Hey everyone, we're excited to announce that Booster Pack Heroes' demo now supports 9 new languages: • German • Simplified Chinese • Japanese • Korean • Russian • French • Spanish • Polish • Brazilian PortugueseThank you all for the incredible support!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T18:45:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225656","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4618570-1844115010494453","game_id":"steam-4618570","kind":"announcement","title":"Booster Pack Heroes launches November 10","summary":"Launch Date!Hi everyone,The wait is almost over. Booster Pack Heroes launches on November 10th!And that’s not all - we’re bringing the game to Steam Next Fest this October (Oct 19 - Oct 26), giving everyone a chance to jump into the game and see what we’ve been working on ahead of launch. Make sure you wishlist if you haven’t yet, so you’ll get notified on launch day. Demo Update out today!Whether you have or haven't played the demo before, now is a great time to give it a go. A new update is li","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T11:04:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010494453","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4618570-1832065502815577","game_id":"steam-4618570","kind":"announcement","title":"small fixes and improvements","summary":"This patch fixes some bugs and adds some small improvements.Fixes:Shop/Upgrade tooltip box now is more responsiveFireball SFX now mute correctlyPermanent tome bug fixedCrit/Block effects are now playing correctly for all unitsCoin track no longer overflowsImprovements:Some upgrades were renamed and their descriptions are now more consistentAdded a toggle to disable screenshakeDaily deals for common and rare units are 1c cheaperMonk and Paladin are slightly more powerfulBoss HP bar divisors to he","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-08T15:41:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502815577","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4618570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:39Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:38Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4618570":"2026-10-26T03:15:39Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4618570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4659940":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:39Z","status":"ok","error_code